# apmond - Access Point Monitoring Daemon
# Standalone port of the apmond functionality of mesh11sd.
#
# Static UCI / LuCI compatible: this script only ever READS /etc/config/apmond (and wireless/network/system).
# It never runs uci set/commit or writes any configuration file.
